        &= \sum_{\rho \in \calA_k} \sqrt{\frac{\prob{}{\rho\circ \sigma_k}}{\sum_{\rho \in \calA_{k+1}}\prob{}{\rho\circ \sigma_k}}} \sqrt{\frac{\prob{}{\rho\circ \sigma_k'}}{\sum_{\rho \in \calA_{k+1}}\prob{}{\rho\circ \sigma_k}}} \\
